  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Personal Notebook
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Personal Notebook
  content: 'Field Notes


    Today''s samples behaved differently from yesterday''s.

    The
    flowers near Bloombridge continue to bloom despite poor soil conditions.

    I
    should compare them with Father''s old journal.


    I still remember helping
    Mother stir soup while Father complained about weeds growing faster than he could
    pull them.

    Funny how those memories make the work feel worthwhile.


    If
    understanding this place means another child gets to grow up in a world where
    fields bloom because they''re healthy, not because something is forcing them
    to... well, then every long night in the archives will have been worth it.'
